{"version":1,"content":"<p>Epic Games行政總裁蒂姆·斯威尼公開批評Valve堅持要求Steam平台上架遊戲必須披露AI使用情況，稱這項政策「令人反感」。此前Epic已公開力挺生成式AI在遊戲開發中的應用。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1583672.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T06:31:38.795769+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T06:22:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T06:27:48.697017+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T06:27:48.697017+00:00","content_hash":"19cc8b40b6ee4391b3074c5df46b3f43c6431f13a3c61027c932f2deb69e0566","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}